he engineering and design challenges that make every ship unique. We'll also be looking into the future of the game and what we have planned :)Whether you're interested in constructing massive vessels, experimenting with different designs, or finding out mor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T18:24:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029939","verified_at":"2026-10-21T20:55:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127480-1847286114027278","game_id":"steam-5127480","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix 0.0.18","summary":"We've released another hotfix for the demo, helping with general issuesImprovedIncreased contract payouts. Now players will be rewarded more for contracts and will not struggle as much for profit.FixedFixed an issue preventing players from renting ships.Fixed contract UI to properly display payouts.Fixed an issue where procedural walls were not counted towards ship height and weight requirements for contracts.Fixed an issue where engines, cranes, boilers, and turrets would not appear during cons","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T02:00:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027278","verified_at":"2026-10-21T10:03:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127480-1846651706691525","game_id":"steam-5127480","kind":"announcement","title":"⚓Play the Blue Water Builders Demo during Next Fest! 🚢","summary":"Starting today, you can play the Blue Water Builders Demo as part of Steam Next Fest! Take over your grandfather's abandoned shipyard and begin your journey into the golden age of shipbuilding. Design and construct ships, manage your workforce, handle contracts, and turn a small shipyard into a thriving shipbuilding operation! What to expect in the demoGet your first taste of shipyard management and shipbuilding as you build your operation from the ground up.Construct ships using our free-form b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:03:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691525","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127480-1846651706688746","game_id":"steam-5127480","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix 0.0.17","summary":"We've released a new hotfix for the demo, addressing several issues and introducing a few big improvements!FixedFixed a potential softlock where the player could not afford to clear a failed sea trial or capsized ship.Fixed clipping issues with deck pieces.Fixed clipping issues with the extrude system.Fixed spelling errors within UI (Blame me, the UI designer)AddedAdded basic graphics settings. You can now set a graphics preset for your game. Presets currently available are: Low, Medium and High","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T03:53:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706688746","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127480-1846651706672956","game_id":"steam-5127480","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix 0.0.16","summary":"We've released a new hotfix for the demo, addressing several issues and introducing a few improvements.FixedFixed contract requirements UI overflow issues.Fixed contract selector scrolling to allow viewing all available contracts.Fixed camera movement while typing in text boxes.Fixed deck clipping in the superstructure drawing system.Fixed superstructure deletion when moving down a deck without pressing Enter first.AddedAdded a proper demo end screen. The demo will now end on January 1st, 1901.A","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T02:26:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706672956","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127480-1846018067941466","game_id":"steam-5127480","kind":"announcement","title":"The Blue Water Builders Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"We're excited to announce that the Blue Water Builders Demo is now available on Steam!Take your first steps into the world of shipbuilding and experience what it's like to run your own shipyard, starting in the year 1900. From constructing ships piece by piece to managing workers, resources, contracts, and finances, every decision you make will shape the future of your business.Whether you're here for the shipbuilding or the management, there's a shipyard waiting for you.What to Expect in the De","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T16:00:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941466","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:49:16Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5127480-1846018067934026","game_id":"steam-5127480","kind":"announcement","title":"Blue Water Builders Demo Launches October 12!","summary":"The wait is almost over! We're excited to announce that the Blue Water Builders Demo will be available on Steam on October 12, 2026!Take your first steps into the shipbuilding industry and experience what it takes to build and manage your own shipyard.Design Your ShipsUse our freeform shipbuilding system to shape your vessels, build their structures, and bring your designs to life.Build Your ShipyardExpand your facilities and develop your shipyard as you take on new challenges.Take on ContractsB","occurred_at":n